  "description_original": "🌊 150 metara do mora = samo par minuta lagane šetnje do plaže! 🌊\n🏠 Jednosoban 68m² – potpuno nov, moderan i luksuzan\n🚗 Garažno mjesto u zgradi\n🛒 50m do Supermarketa Idea + Pošte\n🌅 Terasa 20m2 sa POGLEDOM NA MORE\n📍 Donja Lastva – najljepše i najmirnije naselje u Tivtu\nZgrada samo 17 stanova – pravi boutique mir i privatnost 🕊️\n💎 Nivo opremljenosti: luksuzna nekretnina\nCijena: 1000€ mjesečno – zakup tokom cijele godine! 💰\nKontakt vlasnika: 382 68 261 390\n\n………………………………………………………\n150 meters from the sea = just a few minutes’ easy walk to the beach! 🌊\n🏠 One-bedroom apartment, 68 m² – brand new, modern and luxurious\n🚗 Garage parking space in the building\n🛒 50 m from IDEA supermarket + Post Office\n🌅 20 m² terrace with SEA VIEW\n📍 Donja Lastva – one of the most beautiful and peaceful neighborhoods in Tivat\nBoutique building with only 17 apartments – true peace and privacy 🕊️\n💎 Luxury-level furnishings and finishes\nPrice: €1,000 per month – available for year-round rental! 💰\nTo contact the property owner, please call +382 68 261 390",
